Package: blockr.page
Title: A Document View for 'blockr' Boards
Version: 0.0.24
Authors@R: c(
    person("Christoph", "Sax", , "christoph@cynkra.com", role = c("aut", "cre")),
    person("The Inter Project Authors", role = "cph",
           comment = "Inter typeface, inst/assets/fonts, SIL Open Font License 1.1")
  )
Description: Shows a 'blockr' board as one linear document: blocks in reading
    order with text in between, the board's graph drawn in a gutter beside the
    text. Adding a block in the document adds it to the board. Runs on
    'blockr.core' alone, without 'blockr.dock'.
License: GPL (>= 3)
URL: https://github.com/cynkra/blockr.page
BugReports: https://github.com/cynkra/blockr.page/issues
